  "description": "Core library for StashPup, a flexible file storage abstraction for .NET.\n            Provides unified interface (IFileStorage) for local filesystem, AWS S3, and Azure Blob Storage.\n            Features: advanced search, pagination, thumbnails, signed URLs, metadata, SHA-256 hashing, and bulk operations.",
